  "rhythm": "Twitch owner credit: Acry. Songsterr score 85133 revision 279807 supplies the exact 104 BPM tempo, 4/4 meter and source events. The ocarina follows the upper Church Organ track 20/1 in measures 22-30, the recognizable chorus hook; its tied lower tones are excluded from the monophonic lead, short quarter-beat articulation gaps are folded into the preceding onset, and every written rest of at least half a beat is retained. Hooktheory independently identifies the chorus as C-sharp minor, 4/4, 103 BPM, with a D-sharp4-to-B4 melody range, matching the Songsterr passage. The build moves every pitched role up three semitones for the ocarina. Backing uses Songsterr's String Ensemble 1 chord attacks from the same measures, its lower Church Organ line mapped to OoT Choir Aahs, synth bass derived from the written chord roots, and its GM tambourine plus reverse-cymbal entrances. A soft ceremonial kick/snare backbone is added because the original passage has no full kit; quiet closed hats only fill otherwise unsupported pitched onsets for exact repository synchronization.",
